        "title": "Non Hindus",
        "text": "I hate to have to pay the 1000nrps to enter. Don't think that this is fair and cannot be sure where money is going. Having visited Hindu temples in India for many years and never been charged, it goes against the grain to have to pay such a large amount to enter here. Once in as a \" non Hindu\" one cannot enter into the inner shrines.\nHaving said all that , it is a living place of worship not a museum piece and one can see different aspects of the Hindu faith here. Life and Death exist side by side.\nThe sadhus are always interesting, even if some of them might not be all they seem.\nWorth a look if you have to time( and the money)",
